WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.186 --> 00:00:27.142
That donkey is making a terrible noise!

2
00:00:27.143 --> 00:00:33.326
Polly: What's wrong, Donkey?

3
00:00:33.327 --> 00:00:38.013
Donkey: My owner says I'm too old to

4
00:00:38.014 --> 00:00:46.128
work. I need a new place to live.

5
00:00:46.129 --> 00:00:48.245
Polly: We're going to Bremen.

6
00:00:48.246 --> 00:00:50.939
Jack: Want to come along?

7
00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:54.835
Donkey: There are many musicians in Bremen.

8
00:00:54.836 --> 00:01:00.397
And I like music. I'll move there.

9
00:01:00.398 --> 00:01:10.193
Jack: Great!

10
00:01:10.194 --> 00:01:17.699
Polly: There's a dog. Are you okay, Dog?

11
00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:22.426
Dog: No. Robbers stole things from my owner.

12
00:01:22.427 --> 00:01:27.239
Jack: Robbers?

13
00:01:27.240 --> 00:01:31.625
Dog: I didn't hear the robbers.

14
00:01:31.626 --> 00:01:37.432
My owner was mad I didn't warn her.

15
00:01:37.433 --> 00:01:42.719
Donkey: Want to come to Bremen?

16
00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:53.189
Dog: Yes!

17
00:01:53.190 --> 00:02:01.994
Jack: Cat! Rooster! Why are you making so much noise?

18
00:02:01.995 --> 00:02:04.893
Cat: We're having a contest.

19
00:02:04.894 --> 00:02:11.166
Rooster: Who's louder?

20
00:02:11.167 --> 00:02:16.742
Polly: You all like

21
00:02:16.743 --> 00:02:22.172
noise. Maybe you could become a band.

22
00:02:22.173 --> 00:02:24.596
Donkey, Dog, Cat, and Rooster: Yes!

23
00:02:24.597 --> 00:02:36.787
Polly: Bremen, here we come!

24
00:02:36.788 --> 00:02:45.063
Jack: It's dark. We should stop for the night.

25
00:02:45.064 --> 00:02:51.602
Cat: There's a house.

26
00:02:51.603 --> 00:02:58.008
Let's peek inside.

27
00:02:58.009 --> 00:03:02.107
Rooster: I see two men eating.

28
00:03:02.108 --> 00:03:05.579
Dog: The robbers!

29
00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:11.643
Oh my! Those are robbers indeed!

